    "title": "Why concussion symptoms can be easy to miss after an accident - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Lettecha Johnson ,\n9 hours ago You may walk away from an accident feeling fine only to slowly start experiencing symptoms like brain fog, unexpected mood swings, and extreme sensitivity to noise or light. These are just some of the signs of a concussion, a mild traumatic brain injury that can happen after a fall, crash, or fight. Don’t wait for these signs to worsen before seeking medical care. Read full article",
